text Naranja_IslaMandarin_G00_M02_Text_081661C1 {
    "WATTSON: Oh, {PLAYER}{KUN}!\nYou look like you have a lot of zip!\lThat’s a good thing, wahahahaha!\pFine! I’ve decided!\nI need a favor, {PLAYER}{KUN}!\pMAUVILLE CITY has an underground\nsector called NEW MAUVILLE.\p{PLAYER}{KUN}, I’d like you to go there and\nswitch off the GENERATOR.\pThe GENERATOR has been running a bit\nhaywire. It’s getting unsafe.\pHere, this is the KEY to get into NEW\nMAUVILLE."
}

text Naranja_IslaMandarin_G00_M02_Text_08166331 {
    "WATTSON: Don’t you worry about it.\nIt won’t be a challenge to you.\pThe entrance to NEW MAUVILLE is just\na short SURF away from ROUTE 110.\pThat’s it, then, you have my trust!\nWahahahaha!"
}

text Naranja_IslaMandarin_G00_M02_Text_081663EB {
    "WATTSON: Wahahahaha!\pI knew it, {PLAYER}{KUN}! I knew I’d made\nthe right choice asking you!\pThis is my thanks - a TM containing\nTHUNDERBOLT!\pGo on, you’ve earned it!"
}

text Naranja_IslaMandarin_G00_M02_Text_08166488 {
    "WATTSON: Wahahahaha!\pIt pleases me to no end to see the\nyoung step up and take charge!"
}

text Naranja_IslaMandarin_G00_M02_Text_081664DF {
    "You know, it’s cool to have POKéMON\nbattles and stuff...\pBut if your POKéMON gets hurt, you\nhave to nurse it back to health."
}

text Naranja_IslaMandarin_G00_M02_Text_0816655C {
    "Los viajes en zepelín son\nextremadamente divertidos.\pMe encanta ver la cara de la gente\nque acaba de salir de uno de uno, jeje"
}

text Naranja_IslaMandarin_G00_M02_Text_081665DB {
    "Have you been to RYDEL’S CYCLES yet?\pRYDEL, the owner, is a very generous\nman."
}

text Naranja_IslaMandarin_G00_M02_Text_0816662A {
    "Even if you’re riding a BIKE, wild\nPOKéMON could jump you."
}

text Naranja_IslaMandarin_G00_M02_Text_08166665 {
    "MAUVILLE CITY\n“The bright and shiny city of fun!”"
}

text Naranja_IslaMandarin_G00_M02_Text_08166697 {
    "MAUVILLE CITY POKéMON GYM\nLEADER: WATTSON\l“The cheerfully electrifying man!”"
}

text Naranja_IslaMandarin_G00_M02_Text_081666E4 {
    "“Ride in gravel and shake up your\nsoul!”\lRYDEL’S CYCLES"
}

text Naranja_IslaMandarin_G00_M02_Text_0816671C {
    "“The play spot for all!”\nMAUVILLE GAME CORNER"
}

text Naranja_IslaMandarin_G00_M02_Text_0816674A {
    "Hi, do you check out TV at all?\pThey’ve added a bunch of cool new\nshows recently.\pTV is so cool. I’ve seen my friends on\nTV just out of the blue.\pAnd, sometimes, they even put you on TV\nwithout telling you.\pI wish I would be on TV sometime.\pThat’s why I think you should check\nout TVs whenever you can."
}

text Naranja_IslaMandarin_G00_M02_Text_08166879 {
    "Hi, have you been checking out TVs?"
}

text Naranja_IslaMandarin_G00_M02_Text_081A0D41 {
    "“Selected items for your convenience!”\nPOKéMON MART"
}
